.TH "phoc.gsettings" "" "" ""
.SH "نام (NAME)"
phoc.gsettings \- Gsettings used by phoc
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.sp
Phoc uses gsettings for most of its configuration. You can use the \fBgsettings(1)\fP command
to change them or to get details about the option. To get more details about an option use
\fIgsettings describe\fP, e.g.:
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
gsettings describe sm.puri.phoc auto\-maximize
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
These are the currently used gsettings schema and keys:
.SS GSettings
.sp
